ce5fa33461.jpg","line":74,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"City of Boise explores buying shuttered bar","source":"https://boisedev.com/news/2026/07/14/a-home-for-everyone-boise-exploring-purchase-of-shuttered-bar-property-to-build-affordable-housing/","author":["[[Erin Banks Rusby - BoiseDev Reporter]]"],"published":"2026-07-15","created":"2026-07-20","description":"A long-standing bar could make way for homes. The Boise City Council approved a resolution Tuesday evening to approve a purchase and sales agreement to buy about an acre of land at 3515 W. State St., the former site of Dutch Goose and State Street Kitchen and Drinkery, for $1.75 million. A memo about the […]","tags":["#idaho"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},